gS6(){return"Under KVKK Article 11 you can ask whether your data is processed, ask for it to be corrected or deleted, and withdraw consent. In the app you can remove sharing under Profile > Doctors and research and Profile > Health community, delete your portal data under Profile > Portal account, and get all your data as a FHIR file under Profile > Export my data."},
