gS0(){return"Sa\u011fl\u0131k verileri \xf6zel nitelikli ki\u015fisel veridir ve a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131zan\u0131zla i\u015flenir (KVKK madde 6). Her payla\u015f\u0131m i\xe7in ayr\u0131 r\u0131za al\u0131n\u0131r: kiminle, hangi t\xfcrlerin, ne kadar s\xfcreyle payla\u015f\u0131laca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 siz se\xe7ersiniz ve r\u0131zan\u0131z\u0131 istedi\u011finiz an geri al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z."},
